+**Options and consequences.** Keep the existing archive. Or evaluate a later OCI image derived from the same pinned payload, specifying adapter versus bridge entry, writable state, image digest, architecture, base image and update ownership. That would require image-specific lifecycle and consumer installation proof; it would not authorize Forge to host the image as a service. Public registry upload is separately visible distribution.
